+### eMudhra
+
+For details, see <https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2083449> and
+<https://emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com/>.
+
+The private keys of eight eMudhra intermediate CAs (EM DV, OV and EV TLS CA - G3B
+and G3C, EM OV CS CA - G3B and G3C) can be computed from their public keys. Each
+intermediate and its Sectigo cross-sign under AAA Certificate Services share a
+public key, so the eight SPKIs block all sixteen certificates. The root above them,
+emSign ECC Root CA - G3, is blocked by its SPKI as well, which holds whichever version
+of the Chrome Root Store is in use.
